          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Mostly not. Tekton sells mainly through its own website, with Amazon and a limited number of authorized dealers as other channels, and it warns that some marketplace sellers list older models or counterfeits. Stanley is widely stocked in home centres and hardware stores, which is its main practical advantage if you need a tool today."
          }
        }
      ],
    },
    {
      "@type": "Article",
      headline: title,
      description: description,
      author: authorSchema(Astro.url.pathname),
      datePublished: dates.published,
      dateModified: dates.modified,
      publisher: { "@type": "Organization", name: "The Honest Reviewers" },
    },
  ],
};
